<title>IRAN: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>IRAN GOVERNMENT LIST (970812)</p>
<p>President (Sworn in 4 Aug 97).................Mohammad KHATAMI</p>
<p>First Vice-President (Re-apptd 4 Aug 97).........Hassan HABIBI</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>PROPOSED CABINET (NOTE: This list was presented to parliament</p>
<p>			on 12 Aug 97 and will be voted on 19 Aug)</p>
<p>Agriculture.....................................Issa KALANTARI</p>
<p>Commerce................................Mohammad SHARIATMADARI</p>
<p>Construction Jihad...........................Mohammad SAIDIKIA</p>
<p>Cooperatives......................................Morteza HAJI</p>
<p>Culture &amp; Islamic Guidance.................Ataollah MOHAJERANI</p>
<p>Defence &amp; Armed Forces Logistics.................Ali SHAMKHANI</p>
<p>Economy &amp; Finance...............................Hossein NAMAZI</p>
<p>Education......................................Hossein MOZAFAR</p>
<p>Energy......................................Habibollah BITARAF</p>
<p>Foreign Affairs.................................Kamal KHARRAZI</p>
<p>Health........................................Mohammad FARHADI</p>
<p>Higher Education..................................Mostafa MOIN</p>
<p>Housing &amp; Urban Development..................Ali ABDOLALIZADEH</p>
<p>Industry.....................................Gholamreza SHAFEI</p>
<p>Intelligence (Internal Security)....Qorbanali Dorri NAJAFABADI</p>
<p>Interior........................................Abdollah NOURI</p>
<p>Justice......................................Esmail SHOUSHTARI</p>
<p>Labour &amp; Social Affairs.........................Hossein KAMALI</p>
<p>Mines &amp; Metals.................................Eshaq JAHANGIRI</p>
<p>Oil......................................Bijan Namdar ZANGANEH</p>
<p>Post &amp; Telecommunication....................Mohammad Reza AREF</p>
<p>Roads &amp; Transport..............................Mahmoud HOJJATI</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>OTHER KEY OFFICIALS:</p>
<p>Supreme Leader of the Islamic</p>
<p>    Republic............................Ayatollah Ali KHAMENEI</p>
<p>	   (Succeeded Ayatollah Ruhollah Khomeini on Aug 6 1989)</p>
<p>Head of Judiciary...............................Mohammad YAZDI</p>
<p>Speaker of Parliament (Majlis)...........Ali Akbar NATEQ-NOURI</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>Central Bank Governor........................Mohsen NOURBAKHSH</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		7968.</p>
<p>			   (End Government List)</p>
